{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You are the\u00a0<strong>V.I.P Client</strong>\u00a0of a brand new casino on it's big opening night. However instead of just fun and games,<strong>\u00a0you</strong>\u00a0will need to run for your <strong>life</strong>.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Key features:</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Randomness</strong>: In<strong> V.I.P Client</strong>\u00a0you will engage in different games of chance, all with some factor of radomness and the only thing to gamble is your<strong> life</strong>. Every playthrough will be different, depending on how lucky you are on the odds</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Atmosphere:</strong> Navigate through the casino's<strong>\u00a0darkness</strong> with a<strong> thrilling</strong>\u00a0soundtrack</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Meet the Owners:</strong>\u00a0Escape from the <strong>twisted</strong> owners who designed the whole ordeal. They are all <strong>deadly</strong> in their own  way, learn their backstory and be quick on your feet in order to <strong>survive</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Collect them all</strong>: Find all the <strong>collectibles</strong> to learn about the owners and the Casino's history</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Hope you all enjoy the game, thank you very much for considering :)</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4023940?t=1761130814","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4023940?t=1761130814","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4023940/66ef1e6af077cf331e2cfeb9f0275b0dfadabb91/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1761130814","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4023940/66ef1e6af077cf331e2cfeb9f0275b0dfadabb91/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1761130814","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Playable without Timed Input","id":74},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[2,5],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You are the\u00a0<strong>V.I.P Client</strong>\u00a0of a brand new casino on it's big opening night. However instead of just fun and games,<strong>\u00a0you</strong>\u00a0will need to run for your <strong>life</strong>.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Key features:</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Randomness</strong>: In<strong> V.I.P Client</strong>\u00a0you will engage in different games of chance, all with some factor of radomness and the only thing to gamble is your<strong> life</strong>. Every playthrough will be different, depending on how lucky you are on the odds</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Atmosphere:</strong> Navigate through the casino's<strong>\u00a0darkness</strong> with a<strong> thrilling</strong>\u00a0soundtrack</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Meet the Owners:</strong>\u00a0Escape from the <strong>twisted</strong> owners who designed the whole ordeal. They are all <strong>deadly</strong> in their own  way, learn their backstory and be quick on your feet in order to <strong>survive</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Collect them all</strong>: Find all the <strong>collectibles</strong> to learn about the owners and the Casino's history</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Hope you all enjoy the game, thank you very much for considering :)</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","developers":["AndreaDzn","Deep Phase Studios"],"genres":[{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4023